zable interpretation is warranted yet; the evidence supports association in the supplied dataset only. The most informative next analysis is to use the registered feature_010 interaction and broad binary/categorical claims to test heterogeneity and discover additional predictors, while avoiding exact continuous exposure contrasts and deferring further validation of overlapping feature_010 strata.",
