on in high-feature_018 contexts but are not threshold-robust. I reject H219: the positive sign-reversal test at upper-feature_018 in the clean background gives estimate +0.005, interval -0.105 to +0.115, with the entire interval below the meaningful threshold. I reject H224: the feature_010-by-feature_019 median interaction is essentially null (+0.004, interval -0.139 to +0.132), and the upper bound is below threshold, so there is no evidence of meaningful age-median modification of the dominant feature_010 association. No validation is requested because voluntary validation requests are exhausted; consequently, acceptance is limited to contrasts whose discovery lower confidence limits exceed the threshold, and unresolved claims are kept only where the interval leaves meaningful effect plausible. All conclusions remain observational associations in the supplied dataset, with overlapping subgroup tests, multiplicity, small exposed cells in several feature_063 contrasts, and no causal, mechanistic, or biological generalizability claim.",
