nclusions are observational associations in the supplied dataset and not causal, mechanistic, biological, or generalizable claims.   Most informative next analysis: evaluate the already registered direct feature_063 mean-difference tests in the feature_033 = 1 and feature_060 = 1 subgroups (H286/H287) rather than adding further post-hoc nested interaction slices. These tests convert the unresolved interaction signals into direct effect-size evidence. If they remain below threshold or underpowered, the better allocation is to stop refining feature_063 context and move to broader well-powered screens of remaining predictors or stability checks of the dominant associations, not to continue small-cell feature_063 slicing.",
